@MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5248

### Visos rezervacijos
GET {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations
Accept: application/json

### Cancel neegzistuojanti rezervacija (tikimasi 404)
POST {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/9999/cancel

### Cancel rezervacija 2 (tikimasi 200)
POST {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations/2/cancel

### Sukurti rezervaciją
POST {{MeetingRooms.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "organizerId": 1,
  "title": "Test",
  "start": "2026-10-28T10:00:00",
  "end": "2026-10-28T11:00:00",
  "numberOfParticipants": 4
}